00:29:19.030 --> 00:29:21.990
So what I'm going to do is
there's this machine learning

00:29:21.990 --> 00:29:23.820
API called Vision API.

00:29:23.820 --> 00:29:26.130
You can give it an
image, and it gives you

00:29:26.130 --> 00:29:28.230
annotations about that
image, so everything

00:29:28.230 --> 00:29:29.784
