00:49:03.970 --> 00:49:05.260
and it works.

00:49:05.260 --> 00:49:10.020
And then to look at
the error reporting,

00:49:10.020 --> 00:49:13.300
I'll go to Error Reporting.

00:49:13.300 --> 00:49:16.970
And let's go back to our apps,
and just hit that endpoint

00:49:16.970 --> 00:49:18.240
that will throw me an error.

